# Exo Free — findings by Muse Glimmer 30B

- Source: OpenCode / exo-free (anonymous Zen route)
- Date: 2026-10-25 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: ../../model-comparison.md
- Cross-model signed log: ../../model-findings.md

## Model card

- **Name:** Exo Free
- **Short description:** Anonymous limited-time free route on OpenCode Zen billed as a reasoning model with ~1M context, image input and tool use. Provider gives no official model card; community fingerprint probing reports a 99.4% match to Claude Opus 5.5, but the vendor confirms no identity and the fingerprint is closed-set and disputed.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `opencode/exo-free`. OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions via `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions`. Model ID `exo-free`.
- **Release / knowledge:** First observed 2026-10-06 ~22:30 UTC; virally reported 2026-10-07. Knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `opencode/exo-free` / `exo-free`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens total, max output 131,072 tokens. Reported consistently by Pi/dev aggregators and community trackers; not officially confirmed in vendor docs.
- **Modalities:** Input text + image; output text. Reasoning yes (reported fixed high effort), tool calls yes, attachments supported. No verified audio/video.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-25):** $0 input / $0 output / $0 cached. Free limited time with no end date announced. Prompts may be used for training; no zero-data-retention guarantee. Frequent `Endpoint is unavailable` / 429s reported under load.
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed. No parameter count, license, or weights info. Anonymous lab.

