**Conflicting evidence noted:**
- freeaiapi.org 2026-10-07 hands-on review reports lm.ikale.io fingerprint 99.4% match to Claude Opus 5.5 vs 0.4% to claude-fable-5.1, plus qualitative Blender/Pelican tests with no scores.
- aipromonow.com 2026-10-... lists ~1M context, image input, tool use, $0 pricing, reasoning high, with no benchmark numbers.
- aimodelapis.com lists context 1.0M, max output 131K, text+image in, text out, reasoning yes, tool use yes, pricing free, release Oct 6 2026, no benchmark data.
- horizonlux.com notes data-retention warning and lack of API free tier, no performance rating.
No source provides a verified public benchmark for the exact ID; fingerprint evidence is explicitly described as closed-set matching that cannot distinguish a model from a distillate or router.

